WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A voice says twelve minutes can feel like much more.
That might be appealing.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
But liking an experience and proving what caused it
are different things.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In a famous choice experiment, people sometimes
explained a face they never selected.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That finding is about choices and explanations.
It did not test meditation audio.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try twelve minutes for free. Write down what happens
before a sales page tells you why.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then compare actual files, terms and evidence.
Keep the choice yours.
